    "description": "Animist Base List - Herb Mastery. Spells for understanding, enhancing, locating, and preparing herbs.\n\nSPECIAL NOTES: An herb is defined as a plant that, when specially prepared, provides some unusual benefit to the user. This does not apply to poisons. The Herb Enhancement spell increases the potency (e.g., 2x, 3x, etc.) of herbs; this normally increases the effects of a dose of the herb (e.g., 2x potency for a \"Heal 1-10\" herb would give a \"Heal 2-20\" herb). However, a GM may wish to have this spell increase the number of doses of an herb (e.g., 2x potency cast on 2 doses of a \"Heal 1-10\" herb would result in 4 doses). In either case, only one of these spells may be cast upon a specific herb. Plant growth spells do not work on herbs.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Herb Lore",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "1 herb",
          "duration": "-",
          "range": "touch",
          "type": "I",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster can understand the nature, origin, and value of any 1 herb. If the plant is not an herb, no information will be gained."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "02. Enhancement",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 2,
          "area_of_effect": "1 herb",
          "duration": "P",
          "range": "touch",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Allows caster to enhance the potency of any 1 growing herb by 100% (i.e., x2). This spell may be used only once per herb."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "03. Herb Finding I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
